<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Viral Food Caption & Promo AI</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #ff4757;
            --primary-dark: #e84118;
            --bg: #f8f9fa;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --text: #2f3542;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 580px;
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #ffeaa7;
            color: #d35400;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        h2 { margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 24px; color: #1e272e; }
        p.subtitle { margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #57606f; font-size: 14px; }
        label { font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
        input, select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1.5px solid #dfe4ea;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: border 0.2s;
        }
        input:focus, select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); }
        button.generate-btn {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 22px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        button.generate-btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
        button.generate-btn:disabled { background: #a4b0be; cursor: not-allowed; }
        #resultArea { margin-top: 22px; display: none; }
        #response {
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            background: #f1f2f6;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .copy-btn {
            width: 100%;
            background: #2f3542;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <span class="badge">🔥 FOOD SELLER MARKETING TOOL</span>
    <h2>Viral Food Caption & Promo AI</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Gumawa ng nakakatakam na captions at promo posts sa loob ng 3 segundo.</p>
    
    <label for="foodItem">1. Anong pagkain o inumin ang ibebenta?</label>
    <input type="text" id="foodItem" placeholder="Hal. Creamy Baked Sushi, Ube Pandesal, Iced Spanish Latte" />

    <label for="offerDetails">2. Presyo o Promo Offer (Optional)</label>
    <input type="text" id="offerDetails" placeholder="Hal. ₱180/tub, Free Delivery sa malapit, Limited 20 boxes lang" />

    <label for="platform">3. Saan mo ipo-post?</label>
    <select id="platform">
        <option value="Facebook & Instagram Post (with hashtags)">Facebook & Instagram Post</option>
        <option value="TikTok / Reels Short Hook & Video Caption">TikTok / Reels Script & Hook</option>
        <option value="Messenger / Viber Broadcast Message para sa suki">Messenger / Viber Broadcast sa Suki</option>
    </select>

    <label for="vibe">4. Anong style ng caption?</label>
    <select id="vibe">
        <option value="Nakakatakam at pang-cravings (Mouth-watering sensory words)">🤤 Nakakatakam (Cravings Mode)</option>
        <option value="Witty, nakakatawa, at relatable sa Pinoy">😂 Witty / Nakakatawa (Relatable)</option>
        <option value="Urgent / Limited Slots para mapilitang mag-order agad">⚡ Urgent / FOMO (Limited Slots)</option>
    </select>
    
    <button id="genBtn" class="generate-btn" onclick="generateCaption()">✨ Gumawa ng 3 Viral Captions</button>
    
    <div id="resultArea">
        <div id="response"></div>
        <button id="copyBtn" class="copy-btn" onclick="copyText()">📋 Kopyahin Lahat ng Captions</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script type="module" src="secret.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
